  "title": {
    "zh": "开发版第646周发布公告（小米澎湃OS开发版多机型推送）",
    "en": "DEV for week 646 (HyperOS DEV released for various devices)"
  },
  "postId": "44861440",
  "update": "2024-06-21 20:15:00",
  "release": "2024-06-21",
  "description": [
    {
      "zh": "小米 14、小米 14 Pro 开发版已发布修复版本，欢迎大家升级至最新版本体验。",
      "en": "Fix for Xiaomi 14 and Xiaomi 14 Pro China DEV has been released. Please upgrade to the latest version to experience it."
    },
    {
      "zh": "",
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "zh": "小米 12、小米 12 Pro、小米 12 Pro 天玑版、小米 12S、小米 12S Pro、小米 12S Ultra、小米 13、小米 13 Pro、小米 13 Ultra、小米 14、小米 14 Pro / Ti、小米 MIX Fold 3、小米 MIX Fold 2、小米平板5 Pro 12.4、Redmi K50、Redmi K50 Pro、Redmi K50 至尊版、Redmi K50 电竞版、Redmi K60、Redmi K60 Pro的小米澎湃OS开发版，将于今天24点前推送完毕，欢迎大家升级至最新版本体验",
      "en": "This week's HyperOS DEV for Xiaomi 12、Xiaomi 12 Pro、Xiaomi 12 Pro Dimensity、Xiaomi 12S、Xiaomi 12S Pro、Xiaomi 12S Ultra、Xiaomi 13、Xiaomi 13 Pro、Xiaomi 13 Ultra、Xiaomi 14、Xiaomi 14 Pro / Ti、Xiaomi MIX Fold 2、Xiaomi MIX Fold 3、 Xiaomi Pad 5 Pro 12.4、 Redmi K50、Redmi K50 Pro、Redmi K50G、Redmi K50 Ultra、Redmi K60、Redmi K60 Pro will be awailable before 24:00(GMT+8) today."
    },
    {
      "zh": "为了给广大用户们带来更好的系统使用体验，进一步提升小米澎湃OS系统的版本质量，我们将用全新的「Beta版」模式替换当前的「开发版」模式，这也是整个业界的开发趋势所向。所以未来，小米澎湃OS将提供两个版本：面向前期内测用户的「Beta版」，和面向全量用户的「正式版」。",
      "en": "For better user experience and to improve the quality of the system experience, we will replace the current 'DEV version' with a brand new 'Beta version'. This is the development trend of the industry. In the future, Xiaomi HyperOS will provide two versions: 'Beta version' for early testers and 'official version' for all users."
    }
  ],
  "attention": [
    {
      "zh": "升级前请您务必备份好重要数据",
      "en": "Please make sure you've backed up your data before the update."
    },
    {
      "zh": "具体功能请以手机端展示日志为准",
      "en": "Please refer to the logs on the phone for specific updates."
    }
  ],
